32e3c73b\" title=\"29-df-term\">29-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0ac4b9a122d458e2\" href=\"?note=0ac4b9a122d458e2\" title=\"29-df-structure\">29-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 1.36, p.22, DjVu scan 37"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为非空有限字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\mapsto P_a\">\\(a\\mapsto P_a\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 到一元关系符号的单射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a\\ne&lt;\">\\(P_a\\ne&lt;\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\in\\mathsf R\">\\(&lt;\\in\\mathsf R\\)</span> 为固定二元关系符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\Sigma=\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{&lt;\\}\\cup\\{P_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\})\">\\(\\tau_\\Sigma=\\operatorname{vocab}(\\{&lt;\\}\\cup\\{P_a:a\\in\\Sigma\\})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{vocab}\">\\(\\operatorname{vocab}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^+\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^+\\)</span> 是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|w|\\geq1\">\\(n=|w|\\geq1\\)</span> 的有限序列，位置集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelVar}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2,\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{RelVar}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{fv}_2,\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MSO}\">\\(\\mathrm{MSO}\\)</span> 是下式定义的一元二阶语法片段的标记。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"73f2e90f43692fd7\" href=\"?note=73f2e90f43692fd7\" title=\"29-df-finite-automata\">29-df-finite-automata</a> 的定义，是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 上由确定性有限自动机识别的语言族。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i&lt;j\\},\\qquad P_{a,w}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in n\\mid w(i)=a\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak W_w\\coloneqq\\iota W\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\;\\left(|W|=n\\land&lt;^W=&lt;_{n}\\land\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;P_a^W=P_{a,w}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[&lt;_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i&lt;j\\},\\qquad P_{a,w}\\coloneqq\\{i\\in n\\mid w(i)=a\\},\\qquad\\mathfrak W_w\\coloneqq\\iota W\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\;\\left(|W|=n\\land&lt;^W=&lt;_{n}\\land\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;P_a^W=P_{a,w}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_\\Sigma}\\cup\\{X(t)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_1,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau_\\Sigma}\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal F,\\\\&amp;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_1\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi,\\exists X\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal F^4\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_\\Sigma}\\cup\\{X(t)\\mid X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_1,\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau_\\Sigma}\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal F,\\\\&amp;\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\;\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}_1\\;(\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\psi,\\exists x\\,\\phi,\\exists X\\,\\phi)\\in\\mathcal F^4\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\mid\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)=\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\mid\\operatorname{fv}_1(\\phi)=\\operatorname{fv}_2(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl\\{\\{w\\in\\Sigma^+\\mid\\mathfrak W_w\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\bigr\\}=\\{L\\cap\\Sigma^+\\mid L\\in\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl\\{\\{w\\in\\Sigma^+\\mid\\mathfrak W_w\\models_{\\mathrm{SO}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{MSO}}[\\tau_\\Sigma]\\bigr\\}=\\{L\\cap\\Sigma^+\\mid L\\in\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.36，印刷页 22、扫描页 37。已核对陈述；书中引 Büchi，完整逻辑与自动机翻译本次未重验。monadic 指所量化的关系变量是一元关系，故改正原标题的“单调”。上式在 SO 公式树中只允许一元关系变量的原子式与量化，语义沿用 SO 的集合量化。词结构的字母谓词由具体词构造；右端与左端均为非空词语言类，而非任意关系结构上的查询类。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-finite-automata","status":"resolved","id":"73f2e90f43692fd7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-finite-automata]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-second-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"575d9a1532e3c73b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head